      "evidence": "Step 7.1 defines “varphi:=b_1:X_1→Y_1 with inverse beta^{-1}a_1” and then defines Theta using i_{X_1} varphi p_{Y_1}. But p_{Y_1}:X→Y_1 cannot be followed by varphi:X_1→Y_1, and varphi's output cannot be followed by i_{X_1}:X_1→X. Thus the displayed Theta is undefined. Likewise a_1 varphi=beta is an endomorphism of X_1, whereas the claimed matrix is relative to Y_1⊕(⊕_{j≥2}Y_j) and requires an endomorphism of Y_1 in that block. The automorphism computation establishing cancellation does not type-check.",
